<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,468.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,468.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,468 today from 1,467 on Feb 18, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1565    14.206	  1568    14.236</p>
<p>   1a   1501 11369.000	  1498 11343.000</p>
<p>   2    1857    26.531	  1859    26.564</p>
<p>   2a   1874 15369.000	  1867 15314.000</p>
<p>   3    1633    15.063	  1620    14.943</p>
<p>   3a   1513 11944.000	  1512 11936.000</p>
